GIMP Palette
#Palette Name: antiquity2
#Description: reimagining of my previous palette antiquity16! 16 colors with a focus on consideration for a decent range of skintones. inspired by vintage ads from the 50s and 60s. changes: colors are generally less stark next to eachother now, and have an improved color ramp progression for skin tones. i consider this palette to be what i wanted to achieve years ago, but i didn't have the understanding of color theory then that i do have now. enjoy!
